    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Online Ready is a product built by Abity. If you have any questions about this policy or your data, contact <a href="mailto:hello@abity.co.uk">hello@abity.co.uk</a>.</p>

    <h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
    <h3>From students</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Name</strong> — so a certificate can be issued in their name.</li>
      <li><strong>Quiz answers and scores</strong> — to confirm they've completed each module.</li>
      <li><strong>Written reflections</strong> — only if they choose to set a PIN to continue on another device, in which case they're stored encrypted and unreadable without that PIN.</li>
      <li><strong>A hashed PIN</strong> — never the PIN itself — only if they choose to set one.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>From teachers and schools</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Name, email, school name</strong> — provided when requesting seats.</li>
      <li><strong>Finance contact email</strong> — used only to send an invoice.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <p>We process student data on the basis of the school's own legitimate educational and safeguarding interest in delivering online safety education, acting as a data processor on the school's behalf. We process teacher and finance contact details to perform the contract of supplying the course.</p>

    <h2>Children's data</h2>
    <p>This product is used directly by children. We collect the minimum needed to run the course and issue a certificate, reflections are encrypted client-side by default, and nothing is used for advertising or profiling.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep data</h2>
    <p><em>[To confirm: a retention period needs setting here — e.g. for the academic year plus a fixed period, then deleted. This needs deciding before publishing.]</em></p>

    <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
    <p>Data is hosted with Supabase (database) and processed for email delivery via a transactional email provider. We don't sell or share data with advertisers.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Schools, as the data controller for student data, can ask us to provide, correct, or delete a student's data at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:hello@abity.co.uk">hello@abity.co.uk</a>.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>See our separate <a href="/cookies">cookie policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We'll update the date at the top of this page whenever this policy changes.</p>
